= Firmware =

{{:Firmware/Simple}}

'''Reading depth:''' [[Firmware/Simple|Simple]] · [[Firmware/Technical|Technical]]

[[Related to::Computer architecture|Architecture]] supplies the machine and interface context; [[Related to::Operating system|operating systems]] typically take over broad system management after boot. [[Related to::Computer security|Security]] is relevant because firmware may execute at privileged boundaries and can persist across ordinary OS reinstallations. The semantics of these links are deliberately general; this page does not invent a “boots” or “runs-on” property.

